# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# First matching rule wins (rules are not chained); only relative-URL proxying is
# supported for 200 rules. Cloudflare's own docs list query-string matching as
# unsupported and don't document automatic query-string forwarding on a match — if a
# rule below ever needs to carry UTM/query params reliably, prefer a dashboard Bulk
# Redirect (which has an explicit "preserve query string" option) over adding it here.

# --- www -> apex, preserving path -----------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Pages also does this automatically once marcinbochenek.com is added as the
# PRIMARY custom domain on the project (added before www.marcinbochenek.com — see
# docs/GO-LIVE.md). This rule is a defensive backstop in case that add-order ever
# changes or www ends up routed here some other way.
https://www.marcinbochenek.com/* https://marcinbochenek.com/:splat 301

# --- Legacy /uk -> /ua, ported 1:1 from vite.config.ts's localeHtmlPlugin ---
# (dev middleware: exact '/uk' or '/uk/' -> '/ua/'; '/uk/statti' and everything under it
# -> the same path under '/ua/statti'; nothing else under /uk/ is handled by the plugin,
# so nothing else is redirected here either.)
/uk /ua/ 301
/uk/ /ua/ 301
/uk/statti /ua/statti 301
/uk/statti/* /ua/statti/:splat 301
/mb-ai-uk.html /mb-ai-ua.html 301

# --- Locale-prefixed archive pages: same file, locale stays in the URL -----
# vite.config.ts rewrites /(en|ua)/v[1-6].html internally to /v[[1-6].html] without
# changing the browser URL (used by the language switcher on archive pages, see
# src/i18n/path.ts switchPath/archivePath). 200 = proxy, not a redirect, to match that.
/en/v1.html /v1.html 200
/en/v2.html /v2.html 200
/en/v3.html /v3.html 200
/en/v4.html /v4.html 200
/en/v5.html /v5.html 200
/en/v6.html /v6.html 200
/ua/v1.html /v1.html 200
/ua/v2.html /v2.html 200
/ua/v3.html /v3.html 200
/ua/v4.html /v4.html 200
/ua/v5.html /v5.html 200
/ua/v6.html /v6.html 200

# --- Vanity shortcut, ported from deploy/Caddyfile's path_shortcuts --------
/v4 /v4.html 200
/v4/ /v4.html 200

# --- Unlisted landing for landscape-architecture studios (no site link) ----
/krajobraz /krajobraz.html 200
/krajobraz/ /krajobraz.html 200

# --- mb-ai.pl's own sitemap + robots.txt (host-specific, ported to .htaccess
# and the Caddyfile too) -----------------------------------------------------
# A sitemap's <loc> entries must be same-origin as its own URL, so the shared
# marcinbochenek.com sitemap.xml/robots.txt are invalid served on this host.
https://mb-ai.pl/sitemap.xml /sitemap-mb-ai.xml 200
https://mb-ai.pl/robots.txt /robots-mb-ai.txt 200

# Note: /artykuly/<slug>/, /en/articles/<slug>/ and /ua/statti/<slug>/ need no rule —
# Cloudflare Pages serves public/.../index.html at the pretty directory URL natively.
